# TripIntel Professional Standards
- Use Clean Architecture: Keep business logic (services) separate from UI (components).
- Error Handling: All API calls must be wrapped in try/catch with user-friendly error messages.
- Performance: Use 'use memo' and 'use callback' where necessary to prevent unnecessary re-renders during high-data flight fetches.
- Documentation: Add JSDoc comments to all utility functions explaining the parameters and return types.
- Aesthetic: Stick to a minimalist, high-contrast dark theme. Use rounded-xl for all card components.